- **RESOLVED — Stage prerequisites.** Section 8 now defers to each stage’s forgetting rule. The no-diary result is reported but does not decide the prerequisite. [Design:364](/C:/Users/ethan/Documents/fly-chess-research/documentation/design/neural-learning/replay-diary-memory-design-2026-11-17.md:364)
